abstract: >-
  Public Python helpers for compact Prithvi-EO-2.0-Tiny
  floodwater segmentation on Sen1Floods11 v1.1, including
  water-index baselines, segmentation metrics, event-stratified
  splits, and a U-Net / Prithvi model factory.
keywords:
  - flood mapping
  - surface water
  - Prithvi
  - Sen1Floods11
  - GeoAI
  - Sentinel-2
